### 
## Guarda a resposta da requisição com o nome login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "usuario@upf.br",
    "password": "abc123"
}

###
## Cria uma variável chamada token, o valor dela é trocado pelo valor real da requisição
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}


###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###
GET http://localhost:3000/api/profiles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


###
POST http://localhost:3000/api/profiles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "userId": 3,
    "fullName": "Maria da Silva Souza",
    "birthDate": "1995-05-22",
}

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/profiles/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "fullName": "João da Silva Junior",
    "birthDate": "1990-01-15",
}


###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/profiles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### perfil logado (com dailyCalories e missing)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/profiles/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "fullName": "Maria Silva", "birthDate": "1995-05-22", "weight": 60, "height": 165,
  "sex": "F", "activityLevel": "moderate", "goal": "lose" }

### admin (as rotas /users e /profiles acima exigem este login)
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@nutribit.com", "password": "admin123" }
